The source stencils are vendored under scripts/vendor_data/drawio/ and converted
from mxGraph stencil XML to SVG by scripts/mxgraph_to_svg.py. Port anchor
positions are taken from each stencil's named <constraint> connections (or
re-derived on the bounding-box edge) for this project's routing model.

Feed/Product boundary markers and the (variable-port) Mixer and Splitter symbols
are original hand-drawn geometric primitives.
